OL,3,AEight killed and others missing after
OL,4,Aferry capsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least eight people have died and
OL,7,Fmore than a dozen others are still
OL,8,Fmissing after a passenger boat capsized
OL,9,Foff northern Cyprus, the head of the
OL,10,FTurkish administration there has said.
OL,12,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,13,Fself-proclaimed Turkish republic on
OL,14,FCyprus, said the ferry had been
OL,15,Fcarrying 259 passengers and eight crew
OL,16,Fmembers when it began taking on water
OL,17,Fafter departing the coastal town of
OL,18,FKyrenia.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
