OL,3,AEight killed and others missing after
OL,4,Aferry capsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ship's captain and seven crew
OL,7,Fmembers have been detained as part of
OL,8,Fan investigation into "how this tragedy
OL,9,Foccurred", Ustel wrote on social media.
OL,11,FA search and rescue operation to find
OL,12,Fthe passengers still unaccounted for is
OL,13,Funder way, which Turkish authorities
OL,14,Fhave joined.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
